    "Then someone bought ChatGPT for the team, and the drafts it produces could have come from any firm on earth. That's not the AI failing. That's the AI working with what it was given: nothing.",
    "And when a principal leaves, clients feel it within a quarter. A VIK doesn't replace the person. It keeps what they knew in the building.",
